  <p class="note"><strong>Usability checklist:</strong> provide meaningful <code>alt</code> text for images, keep the entire title as a link target, and ensure buttons declare their type (<code>button</code> vs. <code>submit</code>). Maintain focus outlines on cards, and avoid making the whole card a link when it already contains interactive controls.</p>

