  <p class="note"><strong>Keep it scannable:</strong> preserve a predictable heading hierarchy, avoid overlong link labels, and keep action buttons aligned for quick comparisons. Ensure keyboard users can tab through image, title, and controls in order, and keep availability tags readable against varied backgrounds.</p>

